  - m_Id: 27354524016640
    m_Localized: WELCOME TO THE MARTIAN FRONTIER!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27354524016641
    m_Localized: DRILLERS MINE ORES AND DROP MATERIALS. HAULERS PICK UP THE MATERIALS
      AND BRING THEM TO THE REFINERY.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27354524016642
    m_Localized: THESE ARE THE AD BOOST BUTTONS. YOU CAN GET 2X PROFITS, 50% SPEED
      INCREASE AND 3X VISION.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27354524016643
    m_Localized: THE GARAGE LETS YOU BUY AND DEPLOY NEW VEHICLES.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27354524016644
    m_Localized: IN THE ORE PANEL YOU CAN SEE THE PRICE OF EACH MATERIAL AND YOUR
      PROFIT BOOSTS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27354524016645
    m_Localized: THATS THE BASICS! NOW GO HAVE FUN MINING!
